Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.86,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,If you placed Mount Everest at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:05.07,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,bottom of The Mariana Trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:07.98,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,its snowy peak would still be buried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:10.73,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,under two kilometers of pitch-black ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.36,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,As you leave the sunlit surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:16.51,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,light disappears entirely within two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:19.42,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Below that lies a world so hostile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.33,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,that walking on the surface of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.24,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Moon is physically easier than visiting its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:26.29,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.51,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,At eleven thousand meters down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:31.42,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,the water pressure reaches over one thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:32.94,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,times atmospheric pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.85,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Any standard submarine would be crushed like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.38,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,a soda can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:40.41,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Yet here, ghostly snailfish and translucent amphipods
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:43.44,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,glide effortlessly, using unique organic molecules called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:46.35,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,piezolytes to prevent their cellular machinery from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.40,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.44,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Near the seabed, hydrothermal chimneys spew mineral-rich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:53.59,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,water heated to four hundred degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:55.40,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,In this sunlight-deprived darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:58.56,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,life does not depend on the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:01:00.77,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Microbes consume toxic hydrogen sulfide,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:03.68,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,forming the base of an entirely independent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:04.80,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:07.71,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,We have mapped more of the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:10.62,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,of Mars than we have mapped of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.55,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,our own ocean trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:15.46,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Every expedition brings back species never before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:18.62,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,classified by science—reminding us of how little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:21.36,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,we know about our own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.27,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,What do you think is waiting to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.43,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,be discovered in the deepest ocean trenches?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:30.06,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Share your theory in the comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.00,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,and subscribe to CurioSphere for more journeys
